::

Owners and admins manage members; roles are Owner · Admin · Member · Agent. Owner and Agent render as inert pills; the Member trailing role menu is the dropdown-select above, anchored to the row's trailing action. The invite form is the Action `form` block — Invite sends and appends to Pending invites. G3 pass (WP-N3 08-11): Invite KEEPS its label — it is this surface's only primary affordance. Member rows carry the 22px initials avatar chip (KD / DP) leading each row; the initials ride in the row meta here because `avatar=` parses only on toolbar buttons, not rows — the chip treatment is renderer work. At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the shell contract applies unchanged: sidebar behind the generated tab-bar + FAB, the 880px column full-width with edge padding, and the invite form, member rows, and trailing role/Resend actions flow full-width and stay visible at touch widths.
